# Subagent scratch tests. Four of these reached the repo by `git add -A` during
# 2026-08-01, and one (test/zzRefuteScratch.test.ts) sat on main from 07-28 with
# two tests and ZERO expect() calls — it could never fail, and it was counted
# green in every test total all three sessions quoted for four days.
#
# Naming convention rather than a hook: agents that write throwaway probes name
# them zz* so they sort last, and the cheapest guard is to make the convention
# unstageable. A real test that starts with zz is a naming mistake, not a
# casualty.
test/zz*

